1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,140
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,410
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,240
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:10,010
Did you want to see me locked up
like this with your own eyes?

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,280
I wanted you to see me...

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,790
now that I've become the chairman.

7
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:19,920
I think that's why I came.

8
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,600
I'm not the chauffeur's son,

9
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,770
but the chairman of Adele Group.

10
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,140
I wanted to show you...

11
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,540
the proud man I've become
compared to my pathetic old self.

12
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,980
So,

13
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,280
how does it feel to be the chairman?

14
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,750
Do you feel proud,

15
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,680
like you've been hoping for?

16
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:57,830
Hyun Jun?

17
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:02,300
It's not enough.

18
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,740
Just being chairman isn't enough...

19
00:01:07,310 --> 00:01:08,840
to make me feel proud.

20
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:11,980
What?

21
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,780
To feel as proud as I want to be,

22
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:17,750
I think I need to show you
a lot more.

23
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:20,990
By staying close to Park Tae Ho,

24
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,820
I'm going to take everything he has.

25
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:29,760
What are you talking about?

26
00:01:30,330 --> 00:01:32,760
You'll never be proud of yourself
as long as you stand by him.

27
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:37,300
So please, just stop.

28
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,510
If I stop now,

29
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:43,810
I'll be nothing.

30
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:47,280
Now that I'm the chairman
of Adele Group,

31
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:50,010
I have to show everyone...

32
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:53,890
exactly who I am.

33
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,160
Park Hyun Jun!

34
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,800
Hyun Jun...

35
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:11,200
How much more
are you going to ruin yourself...

36
00:02:11,270 --> 00:02:12,770
by Park Tae Ho's side?

37
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:23,680
All the way to the end,

38
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:26,990
I'll be right beside Park Tae Ho.

39
00:02:28,250 --> 00:02:30,490
While proudly by his side,

40
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:34,160
I'll show you the choice I've made.

41
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:45,940
You need energy to fight, so eat up.

42
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:48,910
I'm fine.

43
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:52,440
To save Jin Ju,

44
00:02:52,510 --> 00:02:54,580
you have to deal with Park Tae Ho,
Oh Jung Ran, Park Hyun Jun,

45
00:02:54,580 --> 00:02:56,410
and even Choi Yu Na.

46
00:02:56,920 --> 00:03:00,020
They're probably full of energy
from eating and drinking their fill,

47
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,890
so how are you going to fight them
if you don't eat?

48
00:03:08,190 --> 00:03:09,960
You should eat something too.

49
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,930
I've never regretted anything more
than I do today.

50
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,360
Regret?

51
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,570
When Jin Ju said...

52
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,100
she was going to kill Park Tae Ho,

53
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,610
I shouldn't have stopped her.

54
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:24,680
When she said she'd throw
Choi Yu Na in prison for murder,

55
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:26,710
I should've agreed to it...

56
00:03:27,150 --> 00:03:30,180
and used all my resources
to help her.

57
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,250
Because I told her not to kill,

58
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:36,820
not to get blood on her hands,

59
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,360
Jin Ju almost died,

60
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:42,930
and got framed, darn it!

61
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:48,730
It's all my fault.

62
00:03:49,970 --> 00:03:51,900
How can you say that?

63
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:54,810
If Jin Ju had gotten blood
on her hands,

64
00:03:55,170 --> 00:03:58,280
neither she nor you
could've lived with yourselves.

65
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:00,180
She's right.

66
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:02,280
We barely have enough energy
to fight them as it is.

67
00:04:02,810 --> 00:04:05,320
Let's not waste it
on self-blame and regret.

68
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:09,820
By the way,
did you tell Min Jun to come here?

69
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,620
I sent him a message, but...

70
00:04:15,330 --> 00:04:16,330
Min Jun.

71
00:04:20,470 --> 00:04:22,500
You left so suddenly
that I was worried.

72
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,200
Did you go see Choi Yu Na?

73
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,600
Yes. If I had my way,

74
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:29,870
I would've dragged her straight
to the police station,

75
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:33,210
but I held back
because saving Jin Ju comes first.

76
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:34,880
But because of that,

77
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:37,750
I found out that she was the one
who hurt Deputy Chief Yun.

78
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:39,780
What?

79
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:52,600
Do you have any proof I did it?

80
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,600
Like you can do anything
without any evidence.

81
00:04:56,630 --> 00:05:00,710
The police said Baek Jin Ju's prints
were on the hammer.

82
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:04,340
The person who tried to kill
Deputy Chief Yun was Baek Jin Ju.

83
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:10,250
She knew Deputy Chief Yun
was attacked with a hammer.

84
00:05:11,250 --> 00:05:14,320
Then let's use this
to turn Choi Yu Na in.

85
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,420
Wait a minute.

86
00:05:17,090 --> 00:05:21,590
This alone isn't direct proof
that Choi Yu Na did it.

87
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:24,730
She'll just claim
she heard it from somewhere.

88
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:27,870
Jin Ju said she met
with Oh Jung Ran.

89
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,270
Did you look into that?

90
00:05:29,570 --> 00:05:33,910
They'd already gotten
to the CCTV and the employees,

91
00:05:33,910 --> 00:05:35,170
so it was useless.

92
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:37,480
We need Oh Jung Ran to testify,

93
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,180
but she has her terms.

94
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:43,880
She must've said she'd testify
if we keep Hyun Jun's secret.

95
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:46,150
Right.

96
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:49,520
But I'm not going to let
Oh Jung Ran play me.

97
00:05:50,590 --> 00:05:52,260
If Choi Yu Na is the culprit,

98
00:05:52,490 --> 00:05:54,430
I can turn Oh Jung Ran
to my advantage.

99
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:04,200
(Bit Life President, Oh Jung Ran)

100
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:14,580
You look thrilled...

101
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:18,420
now that Park Hyun Jun is
the chairman of Adele Group.

102
00:06:18,450 --> 00:06:19,480
That's right.

103
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:22,490
I know this must be
a bitter day for you,

104
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,620
but I'm happy.

105
00:06:24,590 --> 00:06:28,230
If you want to stay that happy,
you're going to have to shut me up.

106
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,630
That explains...

107
00:06:29,890 --> 00:06:31,500
why you framed Jin Ju.

108
00:06:32,530 --> 00:06:34,570
A good opportunity
presented itself...

109
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:36,500
while we were handling
Deputy Chief Yun.

110
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,870
I'll save Baek Jin Ju,

111
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:40,510
and in exchange,
you keep quiet forever.

112
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,410
That'll be the deal.

113
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:44,980
That's not nearly enough.

114
00:06:46,110 --> 00:06:47,980
I'm taking these DNA test results...

115
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,820
straight to Park Tae Ho.

116
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:52,750
Not this again.

117
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,790
You have to think about Baek Jin Ju.

118
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:01,860
Won't my testimony...

119
00:07:02,790 --> 00:07:03,900
be enough?

120
00:07:05,330 --> 00:07:06,330
No.

121
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,330
Choi Yu Na attacked
Deputy Chief Yun...

122
00:07:09,170 --> 00:07:11,270
and set up Jin Ju.

123
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:13,470
I want her behind bars instead.

124
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:17,070
If you want to keep me quiet,
give me Choi Yu Na.

125
00:07:19,210 --> 00:07:20,550
Is that really all it'll take?

126
00:07:20,850 --> 00:07:22,780
You won't go back
on your word later?

127
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:24,880
Do you think I'd break my promise?

128
00:07:26,150 --> 00:07:27,390
Make up your mind fast.

129
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:28,750
Fine.

130
00:07:29,150 --> 00:07:32,160
I'll do it.
Who cares about Choi Yu Na anyway?

131
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:35,130
I couldn't care less
if she gets thrown in prison.

132
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:39,630
Besides, Park Tae Ho and I didn't
get our hands dirty on this one.

133
00:07:42,130 --> 00:07:44,000
What's the point
of handing Choi Yu Na over?

134
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,970
There's no proof.

135
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,270
I know,

136
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,510
but there's a witness.

137
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:52,210
Deputy Chief Yun is still alive.

138
00:08:15,770 --> 00:08:18,340
So he needs a respirator?

139
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,970
It doesn't seem like
he'll wake up easily.

140
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:30,150
That punk, Deputy Chief Yun,

141
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:32,620
knows Hyun Jun's secret.

142
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:36,250
We can't risk letting him live.

143
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:39,120
I'm willing to give up Choi Yu Na,

144
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,330
but there's no way
I'm saving his life.

145
00:08:43,830 --> 00:08:45,360
So you used Choi Yu Na...

146
00:08:46,330 --> 00:08:48,170
to silence Deputy Chief Yun?

147
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:49,830
Even if she hadn't done it,

148
00:08:50,370 --> 00:08:52,740
Park Tae Ho would've
dealt with him anyway.

149
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:55,240
He wouldn't stop hounding us
for money.

150
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:56,470
Anyway,

151
00:08:57,840 --> 00:09:00,040
I won't cooperate in helping
Deputy Chief Yun wake up.

152
00:09:00,210 --> 00:09:03,180
There's nothing we can do
about his condition.

153
00:09:04,250 --> 00:09:05,450
While we wait for him to wake up,

154
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,620
we're working
on catching Choi Yu Na.

155
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,890
So for now,

156
00:09:09,890 --> 00:09:11,160
you're just using him?

157
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:12,660
Besides,

158
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,660
shouldn't you be
far more concerned...

159
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,400
about shutting me up
than Deputy Chief Yun?

160
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,630
For now,

161
00:09:19,230 --> 00:09:21,330
you'll have to do exactly as I say.

162
00:09:21,570 --> 00:09:23,200
Do exactly as you say?

163
00:09:24,770 --> 00:09:26,300
I don't like the way
you're putting it.

164
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:28,410
If you had asked for my help
or cooperation,

165
00:09:28,470 --> 00:09:29,840
I'd still be on the fence about it.

166
00:09:31,710 --> 00:09:32,940
Don't get me wrong.

167
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:36,780
Choi Yu Na may be the one
with blood on her hands,

168
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,350
but you and Park Tae Ho...

169
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,790
are just as guilty.

170
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,050
For Jin Ju's sake,

171
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:46,490
I'm just using your dirty hands.

172
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:49,660
I have no intention
of joining forces with you.

173
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:52,160
If you ignore me,

174
00:09:52,460 --> 00:09:55,170
I'll go to the press
as well as Park Tae Ho.

175
00:09:57,170 --> 00:10:00,910
So wait quietly,
and do as you're told.

176
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:03,340
Aren't you just as desperate as me?

177
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:09,410
I need to weigh my options,
so just you wait.

178
00:10:18,020 --> 00:10:19,020
One day.

179
00:10:20,090 --> 00:10:24,130
I'm giving you exactly one day,
so make your choice fast.

180
00:10:30,330 --> 00:10:34,170
That Kim Dan Hui.
She never lets anything slide.

181
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:37,740
Either way,

182
00:10:38,210 --> 00:10:41,580
whether Deputy Chief Yun makes it or not
is still up in the air.

183
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:45,320
If I give Choi Yu Na up
and reveal her crime,

184
00:10:45,450 --> 00:10:48,090
could that shut Kim Dan Hui up?

185
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,260
You're an acquaintance?

186
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,070
Yes.

187
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,770
I heard what happened
and was so worried...

188
00:11:02,770 --> 00:11:03,930
that I had to stop by.

189
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:07,040
I thought this area had
restricted visiting hours.

190
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:08,910
Yes, I know. I'll be leaving soon.

191
00:11:09,110 --> 00:11:12,110
I just wanted to check
on Deputy Chief Yun's condition.

192
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,880
What are the doctors saying?

193
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:17,720
Will he wake up?

194
00:11:17,850 --> 00:11:19,920
I'm not really sure.

195
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,960
What's this for?

196
00:11:31,530 --> 00:11:33,560
Don't think anything of it.

197
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:36,670
I wanted to thank you in advance
for taking such good care of him.

198
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:41,510
All I ask in return is that
you call me first when he wakes up.

199
00:11:42,110 --> 00:11:45,380
He's really important to me,
you see.

200
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:48,850
Then...

201
00:11:50,780 --> 00:11:52,220
Please take good care of him.

202
00:11:52,450 --> 00:11:53,450
Sure.

203
00:12:16,110 --> 00:12:17,270
For goodness' sake.

204
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:18,640
The number you have called is...

205
00:12:18,710 --> 00:12:22,550
Gosh.
Why is it so hard to reach Jin Ju?

206
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:26,180
I was hoping to ask
where Yu Na spent that money,

207
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:29,550
and what happened
at the shareholders' meeting.

208
00:12:30,150 --> 00:12:32,020
Then you should've
called me instead.

209
00:12:33,620 --> 00:12:34,960
When did you get here?

210
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:39,160
Baek Jin Ju this, Baek Jin Ju that.

211
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:42,270
If you had questions,
you could've just called me instead.

212
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,440
Well, I trust her
more than I trust you.

213
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,940
The Baek Jin Ju you trust so much?

214
00:12:48,010 --> 00:12:49,770
She's been arrested
after getting caught...

215
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:51,310
trying to commit murder.

216
00:12:51,610 --> 00:12:52,610
What?

217
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:54,410
What... What are you talking about?

218
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:57,210
Jin Ju tried to kill someone?

219
00:12:57,480 --> 00:13:01,390
Oh my, that can't be right.
Something must be terribly wrong.

220
00:13:01,450 --> 00:13:03,520
What could be so wrong with it?

221
00:13:03,650 --> 00:13:05,460
Do you really know
Baek Jin Ju that well?

222
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,990
You always doubt your own daughter,

223
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:10,260
so how can you blindly trust
Baek Jin Ju?

224
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:11,660
Because she's Jin Ju.

225
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:15,570
The money for your father's life
and his stocks?

226
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:17,200
While you were stealing all of it,

227
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:20,200
Jin Ju was the one who helped
with the funeral and everything.

228
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,910
That same Baek Jin Ju...

229
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:25,280
is about to become a murderer
and rot in prison.

230
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,050
Maybe you can go visit her sometime.

231
00:13:28,110 --> 00:13:29,150
No way.

232
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:32,520
This can't be. It makes no sense.

233
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:35,720
Are you not even worried
about me anymore?

234
00:13:35,950 --> 00:13:38,020
Why don't you ever ask
how I'm getting along...

235
00:13:38,260 --> 00:13:40,790
at the chairman's house
or what I've been up to?

236
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:44,930
If I did, you'd just throw a fit
and say I'm nagging.

237
00:13:45,060 --> 00:13:46,060
Forget it.

238
00:13:46,130 --> 00:13:48,970
Park Hyun Jun is the chairman now,
and we're getting married soon.

239
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:51,400
Just start preparing for my wedding.

240
00:13:51,470 --> 00:13:53,370
Wait, a wedding?

241
00:13:53,570 --> 00:13:57,580
Honestly.
How can you think about a wedding...

242
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,110
when Jin Ju has been arrested?

243
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:01,480
What does she have to do with me?

244
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:05,920
I'm going to become a true member
of the Adele family.

245
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:08,490
I'll be back
for the rest of my things,

246
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,390
so know that.

247
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:18,330
What is that brat
planning to do now?

248
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:20,130
My head's killing me.

249
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:39,720
Help... Help me.

250
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,460
It's all right.

251
00:14:50,590 --> 00:14:52,030
Even if it hadn't been me,

252
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:54,330
Chairman Park would've
taken care of him.

253
00:14:56,130 --> 00:14:58,000
He was a dead man anyway.

254
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,770
If he dies before waking up,

255
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:04,480
Baek Jin Ju will end up a murderer.

256
00:15:06,410 --> 00:15:08,310
Then everything will be
completely over.

257
00:15:09,310 --> 00:15:10,550
And I win.

258
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:23,230
What on earth is Hyun Jun thinking?

259
00:15:23,990 --> 00:15:26,060
Can I just stay quiet like this?

260
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:28,130
Should I tell everyone...

261
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:30,500
and warn them to be wary
of Hyun Jun?

262
00:15:31,570 --> 00:15:32,640
But...

263
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:36,440
How does it feel to be the chairman?

264
00:15:38,110 --> 00:15:39,540
Do you feel proud,

265
00:15:40,380 --> 00:15:41,980
like you've been hoping for?

266
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:51,160
At the time,
he clearly seemed to regret it.

267
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,660
That he didn't want
to become like Park Tae Ho.

268
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:59,200
I thought he'd say that.

269
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:05,770
Hey, Jin Ju.

270
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:17,580
You made a deal with Oh Jung Ran
concerning Choi Yu Na?

271
00:16:18,050 --> 00:16:19,050
Yes.

272
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:22,390
In exchange for keeping
Hyun Jun's secret, I made a deal.

273
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:26,560
I'm going to prove that Choi Yu Na
attacked Deputy Chief Yun.

274
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:30,460
We'll start on it right away,
so hang in there.

275
00:16:30,790 --> 00:16:33,200
I'm doing fine. Actually...

276
00:16:38,540 --> 00:16:40,070
Why? Is something wrong?

277
00:16:42,470 --> 00:16:44,010
No. It's just...

278
00:16:44,070 --> 00:16:46,640
Don't push yourself too hard
because of me.

279
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:51,780
I should probably talk
about Hyun Jun later.

280
00:16:53,620 --> 00:16:55,920
By the way, did you eat breakfast?

281
00:16:56,890 --> 00:16:58,190
Are you able to get any sleep?

282
00:16:58,790 --> 00:17:02,690
I think you're having a harder time
sleeping and eating than me, James.

283
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:04,190
How am I supposed...

284
00:17:04,730 --> 00:17:06,460
to eat or sleep with you in here?

285
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:10,530
You still need to eat well
and get some sleep.

286
00:17:10,730 --> 00:17:12,840
How else will you have the strength
to help me?

287
00:17:13,470 --> 00:17:16,440
Besides, I've found something
I can do in here.

288
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:18,980
What could you possibly do?

289
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:23,280
Since I'm in here with the police,
I'm going to try and use them.

290
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,080
The police?

291
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:27,520
While you all go after Choi Yu Na
on the outside,

292
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:30,820
I'll aim for Park Tae Ho
from in here.

293
00:17:43,430 --> 00:17:44,440
Hyun Jun.

294
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:48,370
Since you're starting
as chairman today,

295
00:17:48,470 --> 00:17:51,380
go in with a fresh mindset
and do a great job.

296
00:17:51,610 --> 00:17:54,850
As you prepare
for the inauguration ceremony,

297
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:57,280
start by familiarizing yourself
with the work.

298
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,550
Yes, Father.

299
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,650
I'll carefully review
the work you've done...

300
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:04,760
and think about
what I can do to contribute.

301
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:07,490
I'll help by his side.

302
00:18:07,490 --> 00:18:08,490
Sure.

303
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:15,130
Yesterday, he stormed out
like he was ready...

304
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,500
to give up the chairmanship.

305
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:19,140
Did he have
a change of heart overnight?

306
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:21,840
That's right.

307
00:18:22,510 --> 00:18:24,710
From now on, Hyun Jun,
do whatever you want.

308
00:18:24,980 --> 00:18:28,050
Because now,
the Adele Group belongs to you.

309
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:29,550
What?

310
00:18:30,050 --> 00:18:31,050
It belongs to him?

311
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:35,350
The Adele Group
will always be yours, Father.

312
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:37,550
From now on, whenever
I have to make a major decision,

313
00:18:37,790 --> 00:18:39,220
I'll get your permission first.

314
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:40,620
Park Hyun Jun.

315
00:18:42,430 --> 00:18:45,130
Becoming chairman has made you
very thoughtful.

316
00:18:45,460 --> 00:18:46,900
Good. Seeing that's how you feel,

317
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,270
I'm confident I can trust you
with the company.

318
00:18:53,670 --> 00:18:54,770
Ms. Choi.

319
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:57,470
I told you to check
on Deputy Chief Yun's condition.

320
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,680
How is he?

321
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,080
It doesn't look like
he'll wake up anytime soon.

322
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:05,050
I paid the caregiver just in case,

323
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:07,080
so she'll contact me right away
if anything happens.

324
00:19:07,150 --> 00:19:08,890
You paid his caregiver?

325
00:19:08,950 --> 00:19:12,660
You won't need to worry about
any problems with Deputy Chief Yun.

326
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:16,830
Please start planning the wedding
so we can get married...

327
00:19:16,830 --> 00:19:18,100
right after the inauguration.

328
00:19:19,030 --> 00:19:23,130
I've earned the right
to request that much, haven't I?

329
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,740
Sure.

330
00:19:30,110 --> 00:19:31,510
After the inauguration.

331
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:33,310
Let's do it.

332
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:34,950
Hyun Jun.

333
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,510
Do you mean that?

334
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,480
It's what Father promised.

335
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:40,350
We have to follow through.

336
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:45,160
The position really does
make the man.

337
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:46,990
Now that you're chairman,

338
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:49,260
I'm very impressed
by how you conduct yourself.

339
00:19:50,490 --> 00:19:53,060
Then I'll start preparing
for the wedding.

340
00:19:55,730 --> 00:19:56,970
Do it after the inauguration.

341
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:21,730
Hyun Jun.

342
00:20:26,830 --> 00:20:29,070
Hyun Jun,
are you really okay with this?

343
00:20:29,630 --> 00:20:31,800
Yesterday, you acted as if
you were giving it all up.

344
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:33,440
What made you change your mind?

345
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:34,970
Like you said, Mom,

346
00:20:35,510 --> 00:20:36,970
this is the outcome I wanted.

347
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:39,340
That may be true
about the chairmanship,

348
00:20:39,410 --> 00:20:40,410
but what about the wedding?

349
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:44,450
Are you really okay
with marrying Choi Yu Na?

350
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:47,580
Of course I'm not okay with it.

351
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:50,620
But it's what Father wants.

352
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:53,960
I have to force myself
to do it for him.

353
00:20:54,630 --> 00:20:55,690
Force yourself?

354
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,030
I'm off to work.

355
00:21:02,170 --> 00:21:03,170
He's forcing himself?

356
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,700
Becoming chairman
was our ultimate goal.

357
00:21:05,770 --> 00:21:07,400
Why should he be forced
into a marriage?

358
00:21:09,070 --> 00:21:10,110
Right.

359
00:21:10,670 --> 00:21:13,210
Choi Yu Na has to be eliminated.

360
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:20,850
Yes, it's me.

361
00:21:21,820 --> 00:21:22,850
Choi Yu Na...

362
00:21:22,850 --> 00:21:24,890
paid Deputy Chief Yun's caregiver
for information.

363
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:27,160
Use that to take down Choi Yu Na.

364
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:30,530
Whatever you do,
get it over with quickly.

365
00:21:36,730 --> 00:21:39,500
What did Oh Jung Ran say?

366
00:21:39,570 --> 00:21:41,940
She's decided
to hand Choi Yu Na over.

367
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,110
Why am I not surprised?

368
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:47,180
There's no reason for her
to protect Choi Yu Na.

369
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:51,920
Now we'll be able to prove
Ms. Baek's innocence.

370
00:21:52,180 --> 00:21:55,720
Then what are your plans
for Adele Group?

371
00:21:57,020 --> 00:21:59,220
Now that Park Hyun Jun
is the chairman,

372
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:02,230
Park Tae Ho will still have
just as much power.

373
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:04,860
We can't just give up like this,
can we?

374
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:08,370
We must think of a way
to take back Adele Group.

375
00:22:08,470 --> 00:22:09,470
Of course.

376
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:12,740
Once we get Jin Ju out,
we'll start over.

377
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:15,940
Jin Ju also said
she isn't giving up.

378
00:22:16,140 --> 00:22:17,940
She'll go after Park Tae Ho
from inside her cell.

379
00:22:24,610 --> 00:22:27,820
At the time of the incident,
you said you were with Oh Jung Ran,

380
00:22:28,420 --> 00:22:30,820
but you're not
on the restaurant's CCTV footage.

381
00:22:30,890 --> 00:22:32,620
Also, none of
the restaurant employees...

382
00:22:32,690 --> 00:22:33,990
remember seeing you.

383
00:22:34,360 --> 00:22:35,930
Stop lying...

384
00:22:36,530 --> 00:22:37,890
and just confess.

385
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:41,060
Because Deputy Chief Yun interfered
with your father's case,

386
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:43,270
did you hold a grudge
and try to kill him?

387
00:22:43,370 --> 00:22:45,700
What on earth are you talking about?

388
00:22:45,900 --> 00:22:47,140
I didn't even know...

389
00:22:47,140 --> 00:22:50,010
that Deputy Chief Yun interfered
with the investigation.

390
00:22:50,770 --> 00:22:53,910
Did he really interfere
with my father's investigation?

391
00:22:53,980 --> 00:22:57,750
- That's...
- It all comes down to motive,

392
00:22:58,010 --> 00:23:01,380
and I had no idea he was interfering
with the investigation.

393
00:23:01,620 --> 00:23:03,990
That's all just
what Choi Yu Na is claiming.

394
00:23:04,220 --> 00:23:07,860
You should first check
if that's what actually happened.

395
00:23:17,030 --> 00:23:19,100
(Chairman Park Hyun Jun)

396
00:23:21,340 --> 00:23:23,170
(Chairman Park Hyun Jun)

397
00:23:27,340 --> 00:23:29,610
(Chairman Park Hyun Jun)

398
00:23:33,180 --> 00:23:36,650
(Chairman Park Hyun Jun)

399
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:45,630
What do you want this time?

400
00:23:45,930 --> 00:23:46,930
So...

401
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:50,630
you're choosing to keep that seat?

402
00:23:50,830 --> 00:23:54,540
You told me to think about
what I really wanted.

403
00:23:57,240 --> 00:24:00,210
Thanks to you, I got my answer,
so here I am.

404
00:24:00,840 --> 00:24:04,110
By looking away when the woman you love
has been wrongly arrested?

405
00:24:05,650 --> 00:24:07,720
What are you planning to do
in that position?

406
00:24:08,490 --> 00:24:10,990
You should be saving
the woman you love right now.

407
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:14,460
Jin Ju's locked up.

408
00:24:15,130 --> 00:24:18,330
I need to get Jin Ju out
as quickly as possible,

409
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:21,160
so I don't have time
to fight with a guy like you.

410
00:24:25,070 --> 00:24:26,140
I guess Park Min Jun...

411
00:24:28,810 --> 00:24:30,170
will take care of Baek Jin Ju.

412
00:24:32,380 --> 00:24:34,140
There's no reason for me
to be concerned anymore.

413
00:24:40,250 --> 00:24:41,250
Yes, Father.

414
00:24:42,390 --> 00:24:43,390
The police?

415
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:45,360
I'll be right there.

416
00:25:02,770 --> 00:25:03,770
What is this about?

417
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:08,210
Baek Jin Ju's motive hinges
on Mr. Yun interfering with the case.

418
00:25:08,380 --> 00:25:10,450
We're verifying
if he really did obstruct it.

419
00:25:10,450 --> 00:25:14,380
Chairman Park Tae Ho here was
previously investigated for that.

420
00:25:14,520 --> 00:25:16,420
We're here to confirm
what happened at the time.

421
00:25:17,450 --> 00:25:22,490
Oh, please. How would I know
if the investigation was obstructed?

422
00:25:23,260 --> 00:25:27,630
I was cleared of all charges
and released.

423
00:25:27,700 --> 00:25:29,270
We find that a little strange.

424
00:25:29,930 --> 00:25:32,100
Despite Choi Sam Sik's
solid audio evidence,

425
00:25:32,570 --> 00:25:33,740
they let you go.

426
00:25:34,040 --> 00:25:36,940
What? What are you getting at?

427
00:25:38,170 --> 00:25:39,180
Father, please.

428
00:25:39,710 --> 00:25:40,840
We're done here.

429
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,480
This feels like
a leading interrogation,

430
00:25:42,550 --> 00:25:43,550
and I'm not comfortable with it.

431
00:25:44,180 --> 00:25:47,350
If you have any more questions,
summon him formally.

432
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:50,420
Let's go.

433
00:25:53,420 --> 00:25:54,520
Unbelievable.

434
00:25:57,930 --> 00:26:01,460
Why are they digging up
that old case again?

435
00:26:02,770 --> 00:26:03,770
I know.

436
00:26:04,670 --> 00:26:07,700
I sent them away for now,
but this could be a problem.

437
00:26:08,740 --> 00:26:10,710
The investigation we shut down
by threatening Assemblyman Kwon...

438
00:26:11,140 --> 00:26:14,540
could be reopened
because of Baek Jin Ju.

439
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,050
Exactly.

440
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:19,380
I never thought things would get
this complicated.

441
00:26:23,050 --> 00:26:24,220
What if we use
the slush fund ledger...

442
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:26,420
one more time?

443
00:26:27,820 --> 00:26:28,830
What?

444
00:26:29,530 --> 00:26:30,760
The slush fund ledger?

445
00:26:38,870 --> 00:26:42,040
Ask Assemblyman Kwon to stop
this investigation too.

446
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:45,140
Assemblyman Kwon again?

447
00:26:45,340 --> 00:26:46,910
As long as we have
the slush fund ledger,

448
00:26:46,910 --> 00:26:48,240
he has no choice.

449
00:26:48,910 --> 00:26:50,080
Now that I'm the chairman,

450
00:26:50,380 --> 00:26:52,450
if you give me the safe's code
like you promised,

451
00:26:52,620 --> 00:26:54,250
I'll get the ledger and go meet him.

452
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:57,650
We need to wrap this up
before the investigation gets out of hand.

453
00:27:10,030 --> 00:27:12,970
(Garden Ceremony Hall)

454
00:27:16,410 --> 00:27:18,270
(Caregiver)

455
00:27:20,010 --> 00:27:22,350
Hello? Is something wrong?

456
00:27:22,710 --> 00:27:24,350
The patient woke up.

457
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:26,920
He woke up?

458
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:30,650
He woke up,
but he lost consciousness again.

459
00:27:31,250 --> 00:27:34,090
The doctor said there's hope.

460
00:27:35,060 --> 00:27:36,960
Anyway, I have to go now.

461
00:27:39,100 --> 00:27:41,030
From now on, just say the same thing
you just told her.

462
00:27:41,460 --> 00:27:42,670
And don't mention us.

463
00:27:42,730 --> 00:27:43,830
Of course.

464
00:27:44,170 --> 00:27:46,570
I had no idea that woman tried
to kill the patient.

465
00:27:47,540 --> 00:27:49,470
I feel bad for taking her money.

466
00:27:51,340 --> 00:27:53,410
I'll help you, just like you asked.

467
00:27:53,540 --> 00:27:54,540
Right.

468
00:28:06,460 --> 00:28:09,530
(Oh Jung Ran)

469
00:28:13,460 --> 00:28:14,460
It's me.

470
00:28:15,330 --> 00:28:17,300
I'm ready on my end. Go ahead.

471
00:28:17,530 --> 00:28:19,100
(New Business Task Force Team)

472
00:28:19,170 --> 00:28:21,240
Hey, Ms. Choi.

473
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:23,170
Where are you rushing off to?

474
00:28:23,210 --> 00:28:25,740
The caregiver called.
Deputy Chief Yun woke up.

475
00:28:26,010 --> 00:28:27,010
What?

476
00:28:27,280 --> 00:28:29,310
She said he woke up
and then lost consciousness again,

477
00:28:29,450 --> 00:28:30,610
so I'm heading over now.

478
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:32,780
What good will
just going to see him do?

479
00:28:33,020 --> 00:28:34,080
You have to handle the problem.

480
00:28:34,420 --> 00:28:36,690
Do you have a plan?

481
00:28:37,390 --> 00:28:38,420
Well...

482
00:28:38,790 --> 00:28:39,960
I knew it.

483
00:28:40,220 --> 00:28:42,460
- Hurry up and follow me.
- You're coming with me?

484
00:28:42,860 --> 00:28:44,890
We need to take care
of Deputy Chief Yun again.

485
00:28:44,990 --> 00:28:46,400
Do you think you can do it alone,
unprepared?

486
00:28:46,860 --> 00:28:48,970
If anything goes wrong,
Hyun Jun's life will be ruined,

487
00:28:49,030 --> 00:28:50,230
so of course I have to help.

488
00:28:50,870 --> 00:28:52,270
Hurry up. Let's go.

489
00:28:53,070 --> 00:28:54,070
Got it.

490
00:28:59,010 --> 00:29:00,110
How did it go?

491
00:29:01,580 --> 00:29:03,980
Luckily, I can take care
of the CCTV footage.

492
00:29:05,080 --> 00:29:07,080
I'll take care of everything else.

493
00:29:07,350 --> 00:29:10,390
so go to his room
and finish him off.

494
00:29:11,020 --> 00:29:13,420
The caregiver is on a break,
so no one will be there.

495
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:15,090
He's on a respirator,

496
00:29:15,190 --> 00:29:16,930
so it'll be easy
if you just handle that.

497
00:29:18,630 --> 00:29:20,960
Can I really trust you?

498
00:29:23,130 --> 00:29:24,900
I should be the one asking you that.

499
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:28,840
You couldn't even finish off
Baek Jin Ju or Deputy Chief Yun.

500
00:29:29,910 --> 00:29:30,910
But that's...

501
00:29:31,540 --> 00:29:34,380
If Deputy Chief Yun wakes up,
Hyun Jun's life will be ruined.

502
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:36,080
And so will yours.

503
00:29:36,950 --> 00:29:39,880
Our lives depend on
covering this up completely,

504
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:41,890
so quit doubting me and get moving.

505
00:29:42,090 --> 00:29:43,090
All right.

506
00:29:44,020 --> 00:29:46,090
Just make sure
you take care of the CCTV.

507
00:29:53,700 --> 00:29:56,570
If Choi Yu Na gets pinned
for killing Deputy Chief Yun,

508
00:29:58,030 --> 00:30:00,000
then even if I'm the one
who secretly finishes him off,

509
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,740
she will take the fall.

510
00:30:02,740 --> 00:30:04,210
Either way, I win.

511
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,240
Choi Yu Na.

512
00:30:09,110 --> 00:30:10,650
I guess I won't be seeing you again.

513
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,430
You should've just died
then and there.

514
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:30,330
Why did you have to wake up
and cause so much trouble?

515
00:30:33,700 --> 00:30:35,470
I've made
Park Hyun Jun the chairman,

516
00:30:35,470 --> 00:30:36,870
and I need to marry him soon.

517
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:39,480
So stop causing me trouble...

518
00:30:40,040 --> 00:30:41,110
and just die already.

519
00:30:41,950 --> 00:30:43,410
This time,
I won't make any mistakes.

520
00:30:44,650 --> 00:30:46,080
I'll finish you off in one go.

521
00:30:58,160 --> 00:30:59,160
Choi Yu Na.

522
00:31:01,130 --> 00:31:02,170
How are you two here?

523
00:31:08,610 --> 00:31:09,610
Choi Yu Na.

524
00:31:10,610 --> 00:31:12,140
We heard your confession
loud and clear.

525
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:14,040
What?

526
00:31:14,710 --> 00:31:15,710
It can't be...

527
00:31:15,980 --> 00:31:16,980
That's right.

528
00:31:17,980 --> 00:31:18,980
It was a trap,

529
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,050
and you're not getting away
this time.

530
00:31:23,050 --> 00:31:24,050
This can't be happening.

531
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:08,130
(Pearl in Red)

532
00:32:08,230 --> 00:32:12,100
I have to get to Assemblyman Kwon
before Park Tae Ho does.

533
00:32:12,870 --> 00:32:14,470
Are you going to try
to persuade Assemblyman Kwon?

534
00:32:14,500 --> 00:32:18,010
I have to use this chance
to get the slush fund ledger.

535
00:32:18,270 --> 00:32:20,310
That's the only way
I'll have any power.

536
00:32:20,710 --> 00:32:22,480
No matter how hard
you try to hide it,

537
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,780
the truth always comes out.

538
00:32:23,980 --> 00:32:25,050
Shut it!

539
00:32:25,350 --> 00:32:26,780
You still don't get it, do you?

540
00:32:27,020 --> 00:32:29,150
You've already been abandoned.

541
00:32:30,250 --> 00:32:32,260
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
